==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[dish]] [[out]]|dishes out|dishing out|dished out}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To put (food) on to a dish ready for eating.
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To distribute (a thing).
# {{context|transitive|figuratively|lang=en}} To distribute or deliver something.
#: ''She can '''dish out''' criticism but she can't take it.''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|food}} [[dish up]], [[serve]]
* {{sense|distribute}} [[distribute]], [[give out]], [[hand out]], [[hand round]], [[pass out]], [[pass round]]
* {{sense|figuratively}} [[give out]]

